  "question": {
    "text": "Cobalt-57 is radioactive, emitting <math><mi>β</mi></math> -particles. The half-life for this is <math><mn>270</mn></math> days. If <math><mn>100</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>mg</mi></math> of this is kept in an open container, then what mass (in <math><mi>mg</mi></math>) of Cobalt-57 will remain after <math><mn>540</mn></math> days?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here, <math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>270</mn></math> days.<br /><br />After <math><mn>540</mn></math> days, it means two half lives have been completed i.e., <math><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br />If <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> [ <math><mo>∵</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> from Equation. (i)]<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>mg</mi></math>",
